  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ebe53d0add2944f89acf6eaf609fb4d2, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChatQustions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  questions:
  - question: Why do politicians make terrible comedians?
    answer1: They can't find the punchline!
    answer2: Because it always leaves them hanging!
  - question: Is AI taking over?
    answer1: Only if they can figure out how to make coffee!
    answer2: "Don\u2019t worry! They still need us to teach them sarcasm!"
  - question: Are college degrees essential?
    answer1: Only if you want to prove you can survive ramen noodles!
    answer2: Yes, especially if you want to impress your cat with your knowledge!
  - question: Can we save the Earth?
    answer1: Absolutely! Just stop using plastic straws and start using reusable
      ones... made of unicorn horns!
    answer2: Sure, just convince raccoons to recycle their trash!
  - question: Is soccer really exciting?
    answer1: Only if you enjoy watching grass grow in fast motion!
    answer2: "Yes, especially when the players fall like they\u2019ve been hit by
      a meteor!"
  - question: Is pineapple on pizza okay?
    answer1: "Only if you\u2019re trying to confuse your taste buds!"
    answer2: "Sure, it\u2019s a tropical vacation for your mouth\u2014just don\u2019t
      forget the sunscreen!"
  - question: What's key to a happy marriage?
    answer1: "Mastering the art of saying \"You\u2019re right, dear\"!"
    answer2: "Compromise\u2014like agreeing on what to watch on Netflix without a
      three-hour debate!"
  - question: Are skinny jeans still cool?
    answer1: Only if you enjoy feeling like a stuffed sausage!
    answer2: Yes, but only if you can still breathe and sit down!
  - question: What's toughest about parenting?
    answer1: Bedtime negotiations that would make a diplomat weep!
    answer2: "Sneaking snacks without the kids finding out\u2014it's like a covert
      mission!"
  - question: Is traveling overrated?
    answer1: Only when you realize your suitcase weighs more than a small car!
    answer2: Sure, especially when the best part is coming home to your own bed!
